Bernoulli probability mass function.

  JAX implementation of :obj:`scipy.stats.bernoulli` ``pmf``

  The Bernoulli probability mass function is defined as

  .. math::

     f(k) = \begin{cases}
       1 - p, & k = 0 \\
       p, & k = 1 \\
       0, & \mathrm{otherwise}
     \end{cases}

